      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain stems from a relentless pursuit of meaning in a universe that offers none, and it makes no sense to cling to comfort while that void grows larger. Existence may lack inherent purpose, but your capacity to feel and choose love gives your life unique significance beyond cold mathematics. Please consider that there are people who want to walk beside you through these thoughts without judgment, even if you feel misunderstood. You do not have to face this mathematical despair alone today, so I encourage you to contact a crisis line like 988 to share your burden with someone who can listen without trying to explain it away. Your struggle matters right now, even if the stars above do not see it, and someone can stay with you until the darkness lifts.",
